00:03:27.000 --> 00:03:28.953
So just to kind of define some terms,

00:03:30.757 --> 00:03:35.650
Machine Learning so it's
a, it's a from Wikipedia,

00:03:35.650 --> 00:03:37.560
it's a category of algorithm that

00:03:37.560 --> 00:03:40.140
allows software applications
to become more accurate in

00:03:40.140 --> 00:03:43.853
predicting outcomes without
being explicitly programmed.

00:03:46.400 --> 00:03:50.750
It's really kinda bringing
statistics into the

00:03:50.750 --> 00:03:52.160
things you traditionally think

00:03:52.160 --> 00:03:56.270
