00:10:12.420 --> 00:10:14.020
That's a good way to look at it.

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:19.460
So as I said before content
management systems today

00:10:20.340 --> 00:10:23.283
don't know and really don't
care what you put in them.

00:10:24.320 --> 00:10:27.460
They might have some
rules around the number of

00:10:27.460 --> 00:10:30.430
