know unless you tell it,

00:10:43.010 --> 00:10:44.453
unless you tag it, right?

00:10:47.061 --> 00:10:51.380
What changes with AI
and machine learning is

00:10:51.380 --> 00:10:54.750
for the first time like the
content management system can

00:10:54.750 --> 00:10:59.253
