00:11:13.500 --> 00:11:17.470
So major publishers are
already writing content that's

00:11:17.470 --> 00:11:20.810
being published on their publications in

00:11:20.810 --> 00:11:24.300
their print publications even that is

00:11:24.300 --> 00:11:26.780
100 percent created by machines,

00:11:26.780 --> 00:11:31.780
so the Washington Post has
a bot called Heliograph and

00:11:36.410 --> 00:11:38.740
what it does is write summaries of

00:11:38.740 --> 00:11:41.530
